{\small $m$: number of hidden dimensions \quad $\|W\|_F$: Frobenius norm of $W$}

\source{elhage2022}

\note{
\begin{itemize}
\item One global summary: how many dimensions per feature, averaged across the whole network
\item Equivalent to the sum of squared norms of all feature columns, divided into the hidden dimension count
\end{itemize}
}
